# The dev server plays the romance core (F46 decision 4, RM59) on the story pack farm-api serves from content/story-release/
# (F56: `pnpm story:release`, or `--stand-in`), else on the invented stand-in; `VITE_FARM_STORY=stand-in pnpm web` plays
